WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:03.923
(upbeat music)
(claps)

00:00:03.923 --> 00:00:05.761
I can walk!

00:00:05.761 --> 00:00:08.428
(laughs loudly)

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.650
Thanks a lot Andy, appreciate it.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:14.970
Oh, I wasn't clapping for you

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.330
it just echoes in this empty room,

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:18.493
I like that sound.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.730
Anyway what happened was

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.190
I'm backstage at the Largo Theater

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.650
that's where we're shooting
the show these days,

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.070
and there's all this stuff back there

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.000
and I found that cane

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.740
and I just thought I gotta use this cane.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.360
So I came out and recreated
that magical moment

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.003
a little bit from Willy Wonka,

00:00:35.003 --> 00:00:37.690
a little bit from sort of like
a Christian revival meeting.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:39.120
Yeah yeah, it was good

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.980
it was good, I felt your faith.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.090
Oh, I guess I can take this off.

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:44.923
Yeah.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.540
Why are you, Andy you've
been wearing a face mask

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.810
around me since 1994?

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:50.643
Well,

00:00:52.713 --> 00:00:56.081
I didn't want you to see me doing this.

00:00:56.081 --> 00:00:58.164
(laughs)

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.090
Andy is, just for you so you know

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:05.530
Andy, all the time I've known him

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:09.380
now 27 years has been making
sort of erotic gestures

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.652
with his tongue constantly while talking

00:01:12.652 --> 00:01:16.573
and the face mask has actually
been a nice break from that.

00:01:16.573 --> 00:01:17.930
(laughs)

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:18.910
Yup

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:20.480
Yeah, okay that's not.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.313
No, no.

00:01:21.313 --> 00:01:22.310
Okay, all right, all right

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:25.480
let's take it easy there, pal.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.730
Anyway, Andy as I say

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:31.390
you're welcome anytime to
move a lot closer if you want.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.993
Yeah I'm lit here, it's
nice, it's comfortable.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:38.280
You might like to be
a little closer to me.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.963
Also I'm farting.

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:43.640
You're a good man, maybe
the best man I've ever known

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:44.963
but I don't get out a lot.

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:47.290
Now, welcome to our show

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.860
terrific show today,

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:50.600
one of our favorite people Patton Oswalt

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.207
on the show tonight.

00:01:52.207 --> 00:01:54.510
(claps)

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.630
Yeah nothing's more demeaning to a comic

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:58.649
than the sound of one hand clapping.

00:01:58.649 --> 00:02:00.732
(laughs)

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:02.600
[Andy] Good one.

